WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to the AI interview session.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Please introduce yourself and tell us about your background.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Describe one project that you are most proud of.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
What technologies did you use during the project?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Explain one technical challenge you faced and how you solved it.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
How do you approach debugging when something doesn't work?

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Describe a situation where you worked as part of a team.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
How do you manage deadlines and multiple tasks?

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Where do you see yourself in the next five years?

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Thank you for attending today's interview.